{"id": "11102697", "name": "אינטגרלים כפולים – מסה ומרכז מסה של משולש", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_DOUBLE_V2\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;\">מסה ומרכז מסה של משולש</div></div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:8px;\">הנתונים</div>\n<div>לוח משולש שקודקודיו</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:7px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<div>וצפיפותו</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:7px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\rho\\left(x,y\\right)={{CT:1}}\\)</div>\n[[jsxgraph]]\nvar board=JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid,{boundingbox:[{{CT:2}},{{CT:3}},{{CT:4}},{{CT:5}}],axis:true,showCopyright:false,keepaspectratio:false});\nboard.create('polygon',{{CT:6}},{fillOpacity:0.22});\n[[/jsxgraph]]</div>\n<div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:8px;\">נוסחאות לחישוב</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:2;font-size:16px;\">\n\\(\\displaystyle M=\\iint_D \\rho\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dA\\)<br>\n\\(\\displaystyle \\bar{x}=\\frac{1}{M}\\iint_D x\\rho\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dA,\\qquad \\bar{y}=\\frac{1}{M}\\iint_D y\\rho\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dA\\)\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:10px;\">חשבו את המסה ואת מרכז המסה</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:12px;align-items:start;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle M=\\)</span>[[input:ans1]]</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:6px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle \\left(\\bar{x},\\bar{y}\\right)=\\)</span>[[input:ans2]]</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:6px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:6px;\">את מרכז המסה הזינו כרשימה, למשל <span dir=\"ltr\">[2,3]</span>.</div></div>\n</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_DOUBLE_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>מאחר ששיעורי ה־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x\\)</span> של הקודקודים מסודרים, נחלק את המשולש ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:7}}\\)</span>. משוואות שלושת הצלעות הן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle y={{CT:8}},\\qquad y={{CT:9}},\\qquad y={{CT:10}}\\)</div>\n<p>לכן המסה מתקבלת משני אינטגרלים חוזרים:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 16px;\">\\(\\displaystyle M=\\int_{{{CT:11}}}^{{{CT:7}}}\\int_{{{CT:12}}}^{{{CT:13}}}{{CT:1}}\\,dy\\,dx+\\int_{{{CT:7}}}^{{{CT:14}}}\\int_{{{CT:15}}}^{{{CT:16}}}{{CT:1}}\\,dy\\,dx={{CT:17}}\\)</div>\n<p>למרכז המסה משתמשים במומנטים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\bar x=\\frac{1}{M}\\iint_D x\\rho\\,dA,\\qquad \\bar y=\\frac{1}{M}\\iint_D y\\rho\\,dA\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle C=\\left({{CT:18}},{{CT:19}}\\right)\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 24, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "ans21:ans2[1];\nans22:ans2[2];", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "mass", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.4, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans21", "tans": "centerM[1]", "testoptions": null, "q